  "title": "Hype Energy",
  "description": "Understated-to-hype character edit on a tight 144 BPM grid: zoom-blur, whip and spin landings, a stacking photo-card collage, a spin that drops the background to black, then a flash-cut drop with giant stacked words, cloned walk tiles and a chair-as-throne finale.",
